OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FTonight, any
OL,6,Flight showers further north will
OL,7,Fdissipate, leaving clear skies. Under
OL,8,Flight winds, fog will soon redevelop
OL,9,Fin prone locations, particulalry
OL,10,Ffurther south. A cold night ahead,
OL,11,Fwith frost and many places falling
OL,12,Fbelow freezing.
OL,13,
OL,14,CMonday:FA bright start for many,
OL,15,Falthough fog may linger for some.
OL,16,FWinds will freshen in the southwest as
OL,17,Fcloud thickens and rain arrives later.
OL,18,FElsewhere, light winds with sunny
OL,19,Fspells.
